<component>
    <div v-flex="" class="case-pane doc-pane">
        <h2>{t("case.button_group.title")}</h2>
        <p>ButtonGroup 是 RML 的按钮组容器组件，标签为 PascalCase <code>ButtonGroup</code>。容器模式，子节点为 <code>Button</code> 组件。用于将多个相关操作按钮分组展示，提供视觉一致性。</p>

        <Card title="基础用法">
            <p>包裹多个 <code>Button</code> 子节点，组合为操作分组。</p>
            <ButtonGroup>
                <Button label="上一步" />
                <Button label="下一步" primary="" />
            </ButtonGroup>
        </Card>

        <Card title="操作分组">
            <p>用于对齐排列的操作按钮，混合 variant。</p>
            <ButtonGroup>
                <Button label="保存" primary="" />
                <Button label="取消" ghost="" />
                <Button label="删除" danger="" />
            </ButtonGroup>
        </Card>

        <Card title="动态按钮(if 条件渲染)">
            <p>点击按钮增减 Button 数量，观察 ButtonGroup 实时变化（演示 if 条件渲染）：</p>
            <p>当前按钮数: {button_count}</p>
            <div class="button-row">
                <Button label="添加按钮" primary="" on-click={on_add_button} />
                <Button label="移除按钮" on-click={on_remove_button} />
            </div>
            <ButtonGroup>
                <Button label="按钮 1" if={button_count >= 1} />
                <Button label="按钮 2" primary="" if={button_count >= 2} />
                <Button label="按钮 3" ghost="" if={button_count >= 3} />
                <Button label="按钮 4" danger="" if={button_count >= 4} />
                <Button label="按钮 5" warning="" if={button_count >= 5} />
            </ButtonGroup>
        </Card>

        <Card title="示例代码">
            <p>点击下方 Tab 切换 <code>.rml</code> 声明文件与 <code>.rml.rs</code> 后端文件：</p>
            <TabBar selected-index={code_tab} on-click={on_code_tab_change}>
                <Tab label=".rml" />
                <Tab label=".rml.rs" />
            </TabBar>
            <div if={code_tab == 0}>
                <CodeEditor ref="rml_editor" value={rml_sample} language="rust" />
            </div>
            <div if={code_tab == 1}>
                <CodeEditor ref="rust_editor" value={rust_sample} language="rust" />
            </div>
        </Card>

        <Card title="API">
            <h3>ButtonGroup</h3>
            <Table columns={group_api_columns} rows={group_api_rows} bordered="" stripe="" />
            <h3>Button</h3>
            <Table columns={button_api_columns} rows={button_api_rows} bordered="" stripe="" />
        </Card>
    </div>
</component>
